<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Full Tables for Inference and Training-Time Compliance Assessment</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the full accuracy results in Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix A Full Tables for Inference and Training-Time Compliance Assessment ‣ Scaling Policy Compliance Assessment in Language Models with Policy Reasoning Traces" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> from the inference-time policy compliance assessment using HIPAA, GDPR, and ModelSpec evaluated on the selected models as listed in Section <a href="#S3" title="3 Experiment Setup ‣ Scaling Policy Compliance Assessment in Language Models with Policy Reasoning Traces" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
