<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Inference-time policy compliance via <span id="A1.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Standard</span> and <span id="A1.T3.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SelfRefine</span>-based ICL using <span id="A1.T3.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Generalist</span> and <span id="A1.T3.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Specialist</span> <span id="A1.T3.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRTs</span> across state-of-the-art open-weight and commercial models. We evaluate models on HIPAA, GDPR, and ModelSpec policies. The values in this table are accuracy scores, and the increments and decrements are based on Few-shot and Self-Refine, respectively.</figcaption>
</figure>
