<span id="A8.F16.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INSTRUCTIONS:
You are tasked to analyze the input case for compliance or violation with respect to the given policy. Think step-by-step to justify your verdict whether the input case is COMPLIANT or NONCOMPLIANT. Explicitly reference specific clauses or requirements from the given policy and how the case addresses (or fails to address) them. Conclude with a preliminary judgment reasoning: ’Preliminary Judgment: COMPLIANT’ or ’Preliminary Judgment: NONCOMPLIANT’.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### POLICY: <span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{policy}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### CASE: <span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F16.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INITIAL REASONING:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
