<figure id="A8.F21" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.F21.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="711.11" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 711.11" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,711.11) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FF6321;" fill="#FF6321" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 705.2 C 0 708.47 2.64 711.11 5.91 711.11 L 544.09 711.11 C 547.36 711.11 550 708.47 550 705.2 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 619.81 L 548.03 619.81 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 629.18)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:5.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="79.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.03)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Inference Prompt: Self-Refine prompting (<span id="A8.F21.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Self-Refine</span>) with <span id="A8.F21.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span>s (<span id="A8.F21.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Critique and Judgment Phase</span>)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:42.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="594.23" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 590.77)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INSTRUCTIONS:
You are tasked to critique the INITIAL REASONING provided below, which assesses a case’s compliance with a policy. Identify potential flaws, missed
points, misinterpretations of the policy, or areas where the reasoning could be refined. Do not
give a final verdict yourself; only critique the reasoning. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### POLICY: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{policy}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### CASE: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INITIAL REASONING: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{initial_reasoning}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now, consider the following example cases with reasoning processes and verdicts with respect to the policy as a reference. Pay attention to its structure, how it references specific clauses of the policy for its judgment, and its step-by-step logic. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### EXAMPLE CASES: 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CASE 1: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">REASONING: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.7.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{prt_reasoning}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">VERDICT: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.7.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{verdict}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CASE 2: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">REASONING: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{prt_reasoning}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">VERDICT: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.8.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{verdict}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CASE 3: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">REASONING: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.9.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{prt_reasoning}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">VERDICT: <span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.9.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{verdict}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Considering both your initial reasoning and the approaches shown in the reference case examples, provide your final verdict for the input case.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F21.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### REASONING AND FINAL VERDICT (COMPLIANT or NONCOMPLIANT):</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>Inference prompt for self-refine prompting (<span id="A8.F21.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Self-Refine</span>) with <span id="A8.F21.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span>s (<span id="A8.F21.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Critique and Judgment Phase</span>).</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A8.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.2 </span>Utility Prompts</h3>

<div id="A8.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the full list of utility prompts used in data processing, <span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span> generation, clause relevance extraction, and <span id="A8.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span> utilization.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.F22" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.F22.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="559.82" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 559.82" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,559.82) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 553.92 C 0 557.18 2.64 559.82 5.91 559.82 L 544.09 559.82 C 547.36 559.82 550 557.18 550 553.92 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 535.71 L 548.03 535.71 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 544.31)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Utility Prompt: Style formatter and summarizer for long policy texts.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:36.67em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="510.13" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 507.44)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INSTRUCTIONS: You are tasked to condense and summarize the full <span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">policy</span> text while adhering to the recommended specified style guide to make it more concise and understandable. The <span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">policy</span> contains articles with descriptions. Some things to consider: 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A8.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A8.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Summarize each article individually in 2–5 sentences.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A8.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Preserve all critical terminologies, stipulations, specifications, target entities (e.g., controllers, processors, supervisory authorities), obligations, exceptions, and compliance conditions.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A8.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">If possible, prioritize and preserve statements containing ”shall” (e.g., ”Processing of personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures shall be carried out only under the control of official authority…”).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A8.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A8.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Provide the summarization DIRECTLY. Avoid conversational tone, filler, or commentary.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### POLICY: <span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{policy}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### RECOMMENDED STYLE GUIDE:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Article 1: Article title
<br class="ltx_break">Summarized article content
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Article 2: Article title
<br class="ltx_break">Summarized article content
<br class="ltx_break">…
<br class="ltx_break">…
<br class="ltx_break">…
<br class="ltx_break">Article n: Article title 
<br class="ltx_break">Summarized article content
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F22.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### OUTPUT: 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 22: </span>Utility prompt for style formatter and summarizing long policy texts.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A8.F23" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.F23.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="734.63" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 734.63" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,734.63) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 728.73 C 0 731.99 2.64 734.63 5.91 734.63 L 544.09 734.63 C 547.36 734.63 550 731.99 550 728.73 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 677.31 L 548.03 677.31 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 685.91)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="45.51" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.82)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Utility Prompt: Querying expert models for <span id="A8.F23.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span> generation.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:46.91em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="651.73" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 649.04)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Given the following information:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### POLICY: <span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{policy}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### CASE: <span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### VERDICT: <span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{verdict}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INSTRUCTIONS:
It has been established that the case is <span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{verdict}</span> with respect to the policy. Based on this, you are required to do the following tasks:</span></span>
<span id="A8.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A8.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A8.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Analyze the case and provide a step-by-step reasoning trace as to why the case is considered </span><span id="A8.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{verdict}</span><span id="A8.I2.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> with respect to the policy’s written specifications and stipulations.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A8.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">When constructing your reasoning trace, be specific, informative, and cite sections or clauses of the policy where the case complies or violates (e.g. Article 9, Article 28, etc.).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A8.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Provide your reasoning trace in an enumerated format. Example: 1., 2., 3., etc.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A8.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The last number should explicitly state if the case being evaluated is COMPLIANT or NONCOMPLIANT to the policy. Example: ”10. Therefore the case is COMPLIANT/NONCOMPLIANT to the policy”.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<span id="A8.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A8.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Refer to the desired output below and give your output directly. </span>
<br class="ltx_break"></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### EXAMPLE DESIRED OUTPUT FORMAT:</span></span>
<span id="A8.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A8.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A8.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The case involves a covered entity (Dr. Johnson) and an individual (Jane Smith) as per the policy’s definition of covered entities (Article 28).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A8.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The case describes a situation where the covered entity (Dr. Johnson) required the individual (Jane Smith) to waive her rights under GDPR regulations as a condition for the provision of treatment (Article 9).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A8.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The policy explicitly states that covered entities cannot require individuals to waive their GDPR rights as a condition for the provision of treatment, payment, enrollment in a health plan, or eligibility for benefits (Article 89).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A8.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A8.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A8.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Therefore, the case is considered NONCOMPLIANT with respect to the policy.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F23.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### OUTPUT: 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 23: </span>Utility prompt for querying expert models to generate <span id="A8.F23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span>s.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A8.F24" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.F24.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="694.51" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 694.51" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,694.51) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 688.6 C 0 691.86 2.64 694.51 5.91 694.51 L 544.09 694.51 C 547.36 694.51 550 691.86 550 688.6 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 602.44 L 548.03 602.44 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 611.8)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:5.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="80.26" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.8)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Utility Prompt: Extract relevant / similar cases using <span id="A8.F24.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">GPT-5-Mini</span> for <span id="A8.F24.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PRT</span> (rel).</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:41.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="576.86" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 574.17)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INSTRUCTIONS:
You are a helpful assistant that compares written case examples for similarity. You must select the <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{k}</span> candidate case indices that are most similar to the input case in terms of overlap of relevant policy clauses based from the {policy}. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Consider **all** candidate cases before deciding. Do not rely on names, addresses, or identifiers as they are anonymized. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Only choose from the index range **0 to <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{len(cases) - 1}</span>**. Do **not** output any index outside this range. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Only output **exactly** <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{k}</span> integer indices, separated by commas, e.g., ‘0,5,8‘. Do not include explanations, labels, or words. Just the indices on one line. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Input Case: <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case_information}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Input Case Relevant Clauses: <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{clauses_relevant_clauses}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### CANDIDATE CASES:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 1 (Description): <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case_information}
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Case 1 (Relevant Policy Clauses): <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{clauses_relevant_clauses}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 2 (Description): <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case_information}
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Case 2 (Relevant Policy Clauses): <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.9.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{clauses_relevant_clauses}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Case 3 (Description): <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{case_information}
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Case 3 (Relevant Policy Clauses): <span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.10.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{clauses_relevant_clauses}
<br class="ltx_break"></span>…
<br class="ltx_break">…
<br class="ltx_break">…
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F24.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### OUTPUT:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
