</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:18.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="261.37" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 258.68)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.F25.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### INSTRUCTIONS:
From the following reasoning text, extract all policy sections mentioned. Be flexible; mentions can be contracted, such as <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">’Article 1,3,4’</span>, or written fully, like <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">’Article 1, Article 2, Article 3,…’</span>. Also, if there is a mismatch in spaces, count them the same like <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">’Article1’</span> and <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">’Article 1’</span> are the same. Return only as a comma-separated list (e.g., <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">’Article 1, Article 3, Article 4’</span>). 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### POLICY SECTION LIST: <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{policy_section_masterlist}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### REASONING TEXT: <span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{reasoning_text}</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F25.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### OUTPUT:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
